name: sim.getConfigurationTree
description: Deprecated
luaSynopsis: string buffer=sim.getConfigurationTree(int objectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the object that is at the base of the tree (all objects built on top of this one (including this one)) will have their configuration retrieved. sim.handle_all will retrieve the configuration for the whole scene
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. buffer: use that value to restore the configuration tree with sim.setConfigurationTree.
